Package: qt6-declarative-dev
Version: @DEB_QTDECLARATIVE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-declarative (= @DEB_QTDECLARATIVE_V@), qt6-base-dev, qt6-shadertools-dev
Description: Development files for Qt 6 QML and QtQuick
 Headers, CMake package files, metatypes and tools for building software
 against QtQml and QtQuick, including the qml runtime launcher used for
 on-device smoke tests. Needed to cross-build KDE Frameworks and Plasma.
